force ?? 0))\")","}","print(forces)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"kite: 3.0\", \"rocket: 5.0\"]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rock holds neither a wind nor a thrust, so it doesn’t match the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" term."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The view is lazy: it finds the matching entities as you iterate it."}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}]},{"text":") for ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"t","type":"text"}]},{"text":" terms to create. Iterating is O(","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"text":") for ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"text":" entities in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"smallest component term or required type, or every entity when there’s none.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Complexity","style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/query(_:)-4yi98"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"WorldModule","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"query","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Query","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV"},{"text":"<repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"QueryView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryViewV"},{"text":"<repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").","kind":"text"},{"text":"Value","